=== Constants Issue Demo ===
DefaultValue.constant = 0 (should be 7)
traits.ctraits._CONSTANT_DEFAULT_VALUE = 0 (should be 7)

This means in traits/constants.py:
line: constant = traits.ctraits._CONSTANT_DEFAULT_VALUE
evaluates to: constant = 0
so DefaultValue.constant = 0

The fix should be to change traits/ctraits to have:
_CONSTANT_DEFAULT_VALUE = 7
Or change traits/constants.py to use:
constant = 7  # instead of traits.ctraits._CONSTANT_DEFAULT_VALUE
